<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Franklin Resources raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Franklin Resources raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities has raised its rating for Franklin Resources Inc to buy from hold, a source at the brokerage said on Friday.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares opened up 3/8 to 54-7/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730))</p>
